  "source_description": "BANKNIFTY entry model, 5-min horizon rare-label recipe (rediscovered 2026-09-04 from an abandoned 2026-07-12 experiment; retrained fresh against the now fully-fixed training data -- schema-drift, IV-scale, and ctx_gap_* context-loader fixes all applied to the full 2024-11-04..2026-07-31 backfill before this run). Binary label: |move|>=0.15% (level-invariant) in 5min, either direction. Holdout AUC 0.7251 vs current live dhan_entry_015pct_v1 (0.618) and vs a same-methodology 15-min retrain attempt (0.636) -- this is a genuinely different, better-ranking model. Ship gates: 3/4 pass (fails separation>=0.15). Engine-level backtest (Feb-Jul 2026, tier==live only, capital-weighted): return on capital deployed +0.52% vs current live models +0.58% -- essentially flat to slightly worse on a real-money basis despite the better AUC, and worse tail risk (worst trade -Rs2097 vs -Rs1434). Deployed 2026-09-04 as a deliberate live trial per user instruction, despite the mixed backtest, to observe real trades before deciding next steps.",
